WEBVTT

08:56.983 --> 08:59.773
<b>And then you've got
those mononoke who came for me.</b>

09:00.113 --> 09:01.573
<b>They still woke me up,</b>

09:01.613 --> 09:04.573
<b>knowing full well they'd
have to answer to the Bureau.</b>

09:04.783 --> 09:07.243
<b>They're not gonna
throw their hands up and turn tail.</b>
